Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Digital One Piece
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we Dorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-I-YYYYYYYYY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,хeiy C'mon let's go everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on let's go, baby baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the one dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby,\Nalways share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see or to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought up by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top, we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.52,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Always share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Always share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks, lady. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine anyone hating frills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You men are just too strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, thanks for taking them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye for real this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all men so hasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rest till I know my\Nfriend survived like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:02:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as long as they're alive, we\Ncan get back up and keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get stronger\Nthan all those guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll walk all the way back\Nto Sabaody on my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll toughen me up for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you could get me a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really are hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a calm belt? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This island lies in an\Narea known as a calm belt,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's surrounded by a\Ngiant den of sea kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's another reason sailors\Nnever dare to come near this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Castaways do sometimes make\Ntheir way to our shores,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but they almost always do so as corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but you said your leader\Nwas part of a pirate crew, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship of our snake princess, the Yuda,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is pulled by two giant\Npoisonous sea snakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so even sea kings don't dare to attack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's the only ship\Non Amazon Lily. Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I just build a raft\Nand paddle all the way there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just build a raft and\Npaddle all the way there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you weren't joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's already falling apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no obligation to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do all men sink like a rock\Neven if they're sailors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If only Franky was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one with problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to cling to me when you\Nshould have been running away from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up much longer, I'll\Nend up growing attached to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you know come to think of it these arrows
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,are crazy strong those\Ngirls were chasing me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier they were busting\Nup stone walls with
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,those things doesn't look\Nlike there's anything
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,special about them though\Nwell of course these
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,arrows are strong they're\Nimbued with our Haki
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mocking me? Are\Nyou to me Haki? I never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,heard of it there she\Nis margaret are you safe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:06:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you made it the man's with\Nher strike him down coward
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,come back forgive me if you were injured\Nmargaret but our situation is quite
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,dire the snake princess has returned so\Nwe must vanquish this fiend post-haste
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we did notice the\Nsea kings. Thank you the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,sea prism stone on this\Nbattleship may conceal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,our presence from the\Nbeasts for a while but
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,after waiting here for\Nso long they eventually
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,caught on and attacked\Nus we would prefer to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,avoid such encounters but\Nas you know the agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,between the kuja and the\Ngovernment forbids us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,from getting closer than\Nthree kilometers from
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So, like fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,here we are waiting in a monster's nest\Nwhile you ladies take your sweet time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that the ruler of the Kuja is\Na monster that can turn people to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:06:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed that sea king?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can color me impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those of us who travel on the Grand Line\Nare no strangers to these creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But the ones here in the Calm Belt are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,certainly larger and\Ndecidedly more ferocious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our cannons didn't even\Nleave a mark on that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster though it may be, if I allowed\Nthat beast to devour a marine vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I call myself a vice-admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not here to hunt sea\Nkings or to chat about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us conduct our business quickly\Nso that I may leave these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words are as sharp as your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hear them well, Kuja pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I tire of waiting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Vice Admiral Momonga\Nof Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Warlord of the Sea and\NPirate Empress Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Snake Princess does not\Ncater to your beck and call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's your answer. You\Nmight as well go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at those ugly men.\NI'm sophisticated. Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen a live one in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever pirates or merchants see the\NKuja flag flying above the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They play in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That laugh isn't very ladylike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We received a message from your princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She claimed that she would\Nreply to our summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But now it appears she\Nwas not quite sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning's paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A place and date has been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For the public execution of Portgas D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace The second division commander\Nof the whitebeard pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no turning back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government has\Nissued strict orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That the seven warlords\Nof the sea assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Refuse and our agreement will become void?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and your princess's title\Nas warlord will be revoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you had the audacity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to place this kitten in my path?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies, Empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for full responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, Bower Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the pirate Empress?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the most beautiful\Nwoman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you've come for me at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stubborn and meddlesome, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of keeping my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I refuse\Nto go to war for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I rather like my position as a\Nwarlord, so I think I shall keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you shall give me all the cargo\Non your ship quickly without complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for you\Nacting like a spoiled child!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think we'll\Naccept such unreasonable demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Haul it over, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Order me around some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that cargo down this instant\Nor I'll throw you overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.26,0:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn't resist her, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Porcus Deace's public execution\Nwill be exactly one week from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The event will be held in the\Ntown square of Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we're doing this\Ninside of Navy Headquarters itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt that Whitebeard will\Nattempt to rescue him in the next few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,likely with the strength of\Nhis entire crew behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the leadership of three admirals,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and with the aid of the\Nseven warlords of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters is determined\Nto stop him at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you give up the title of\Nwarlord or accept your orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your decision quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've kept us waiting long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you I like being a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I loathe the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in\Nfollowing their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely I can find a better solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How does this sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marines who came to escort\Nme had a mysterious accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When they were discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,they had all been transformed into\Nstone and were promptly disposed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's planning to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard about Hancock doing this before\Na merchant ship was attacked by the Kuja
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates and when it was discovered later\NThere weren't any crew members on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of weird statues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't people are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean they were all turned to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of these threats your\Ntemper tantrums will not be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our big sister has a rotten personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end she always\Ngets her way Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's a very good reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because no matter what I do, even if I kick\Na kitten, even if I yank off your ears,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,why, even if I were to commit\Nmurder, the world would forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is because, yes, it\Nis because I am beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, you can abuse me all you\Nwant, your highness. Stop that, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The guilty thoughts swimming in your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,hearts shall turn your flesh to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Love love be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'd expect no less\Nfrom a Navy Vice Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever, forcing the wicked\Nthoughts from your mind with pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I do applaud your conviction, though I\Ncan't extend that compliment to your men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But one is not zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall return to our\Npeaceful home of Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, Snake Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't turn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to return empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you reappear in two days,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,your position will be revoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Kashi Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're glad you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, snake princess! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking good, Ron! Yes, Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought back lots of moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.32,0:15:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna join the pirates when I grow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Gorgon Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Snake Principal! Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've prepared a monkey carriage for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything to report? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron ore, gunpowder,\Nalcohol, and northern crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What a truly impressive haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we plundered a couple of\Nmerchant vessels in one pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the loads\Nof cargo we claimed from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,a central government ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You Kashi Pirates really are\Na force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,on the way to the castle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron, did you collect any\Nbooks? Grignion. Books, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.44,0:16:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we did appropriate a recent newspaper\Noff the central government ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, snake princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so glad to have you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake princess, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiative, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The children of the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,lovingly crafted a statue of your\Nlikeness out of clay as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's endearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How much love and labor they\Npoured into its creation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It took them forever to\Nbring it up to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it would break if they dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But made out of mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bring such filth into the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inelegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw it away at once and clean the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, Anishita.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? About?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but\Nnotice the city defenders
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,were absent from the\Nwharf upon our arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you see, a ferocious and violent monkey\Ncame rampaging out of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The size and brute strength of\Nthe beast was simply astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So everyone has left for\Nthe jungle to hunt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be back shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry they\Nweren't there to greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, would you care for a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and make that\Ntwo while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny Moon, how nice of you\Nto defile my private chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't see you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget how I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Snake Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen, Snake Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have just learned that there's a ship\Nfrom Central anchored off our shores.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They've come here with the express\Npurpose of summoning you, have they, Nyot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Central Government has\Nordered you into active duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. They want me to go to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go You must uphold the\Nagreement or they'll revoke your title.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've just returned. But surely\Nyou still have the strength to fight? I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's like a weird old puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm not sorry for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, think this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All that is truly protecting our\Nnation is your title as warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our greatest deterrence\Nfrom outside forces?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Amazon Lily's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in the Sea King riddled\Nwaters of the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But as time marches\Nforward, so does technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And now these central dwellers have ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That provide them with safe\Npassage through these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a new weapon to keep them at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your rank as warlord is the sole\Nreason they avoid our shores,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,despite the activities\Nof the Kuja pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our island is home to\Nhelpless children and elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lost your title, Amazon Lily\Nwould just be another nation of pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and the government would bring ruin to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're the one who\Nsounds like she's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I could drop dead at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaze into this crystal\Nball and see your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall conjure an image of your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.57,0:20:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Snake Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I listen respectfully and\Nyou treat me like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd fall for your chicanery?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:21:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign here ended well\Nover three generations ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you act like you're\Nstill the empress of Amazon Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloriosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I could lay waste to every\Ninch of this nation of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,On a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And still, I would be forgiven\Nbecause I'm beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks down on people\Nso much that she looks up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why on earth should I listen\Nto the words of a disgraced
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,ruler who abandoned her people\Nto journey the outer seas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor to the Kuja!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I live alone in penance\Non the outskirts of town!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is where you should\Nbe at this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not presume to tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the reigning empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Say princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, I can't help but\Nadmire your overwhelming passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be right
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You agreed to my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for understanding\Nthe needs of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So how soon will you be leaving\Nnever know your place fool? You!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll curse on you, Snake Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess, you threw\Nan old woman out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.06,0:22:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,An accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We know it wasn't your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny Neon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be old, but I'm\Nstill a Kuja warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My skills haven't withered a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Snake Princess will now bathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must evacuate the castle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, we've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.22,0:23:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I just sat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.05,0:23:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's bath time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.70,0:23:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're clearing out the castle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.38,0:23:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about to get packed in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,For the next several hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,no one is allowed to enter the\Ncastle under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.68,0:23:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it such a big deal when\Nthe universe takes a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone acts like we're\Ngoing to war or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,First things first, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then I think I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't mean the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the Gorgon was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It stalked the tides\Nof the central oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.14,0:23:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone made the mistake of gazing\Nupon this horrifying creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They would be turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.28,0:23:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After facing countless perils\Nalong a treacherous journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess and her sisters encountered\Nthe monster and managed to slay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.52,0:24:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the screams of the dying abomination?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,were laced with evil, and it\Nplaced the sisters under a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The penetrating eyes of the monster were\Netched across the flesh of the sisters'
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.32,0:24:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So they remain forever\Nstaring, even today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.34,0:24:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And if anyone gazes\Nupon these wicked eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,their body will harden into\Nstone, and they'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.74,0:24:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the Gorgon sisters refused to\Nremove their clothing before another human.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.70,0:24:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of precaution, they\Nalways post guards when they bathe and
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.04,0:24:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,they secure and evacuate the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.88,0:24:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,did you see where he went yeah he
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,ran up the side of the mountain you\Ndon't think he could be headed back
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to the village do you i thought he\Nwas bound and determined to find a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.44,0:25:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship, okay. Now what's\Nnext? Wait a sec. Margaret
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.98,0:25:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,did say they've got a pirate ship i wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.66,0:25:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,how hard it'd be to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.50,0:25:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,borrow it that won't
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.20,0:25:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Work. Nami's not here.\NI'd get lost in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.22,0:25:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Without her, I got it all. I gotta ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.18,0:25:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,someone for a ride in their ship wherever
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.38,0:25:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,they're going i'm sure they won't mind a
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.98,0:25:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,quick trip to Sabo Outta\Nso who am i gonna ask
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.94,0:25:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,for a ride probably gotta\Nbe someone important
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.22,0:25:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and high up and if they're high up that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,means they gotta live in a tall building
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, my head's on fire\Nfrom all this thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.48,0:25:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, guess I'll just try the first tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.76,0:25:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,building i can find we
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.50,0:25:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,need to hurry by this
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.90,0:25:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,point the snake princess\Nhas probably returned
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.06,0:26:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be in trouble if she finds the man
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.76,0:26:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? The roof of\Nthe castle tower collapsed. No
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. That's where\Nthe empress is taking a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.88,0:26:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real shallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.24,0:26:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.94,0:26:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.42,0:26:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,a huge bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, hey, that thing on your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.86,0:27:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks kind of familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.46,0:27:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it?
